  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "You are given a tree containing NNN nodes numbered from 111 to NNN such that the ithi^{th}ith node has a value AiA_iAi​ assigned to it. The root of the tree is node 111.\n\nThe power of each node is the **maximum** value assigned to any node present in the subtree of the node.\n\nYou are given an integer XXX. Your task is to make the **sum** of the powers of **all** the nodes of the tree **greater than or equal** to XXX. For this, you can perform the following operation:\n\n\nChoose any node iii (1≤i≤N)(1 \\le i \\le N)(1≤i≤N) and set Ai:=Ai+1A_i := A_i + 1Ai​:=Ai​+1.\nFind the **minimum** number of operations required to make the **sum** of the powers of **all** the nodes of the tree **greater than or equal** to XXX.\n\nNote that, the subtree of a node VVV is the set of all nodes UUU such that VVV lies on the simple path from UUU to the root.\n\n\nInput Format\n\nThe first line of input will contain a single integer TTT, denoting the number of test cases.\nEach test case consists of multiple lines of input.\n\nThe first line of each test case contains two integers NNN and XXX — the number of nodes and the target sum XXX.\nThe second line contains NNN integers - A1,A2,…,ANA_1,A_2,\\ldots, A_NA1​,A2​,…,AN​, the values assigned to the nodes.\nThe next N−1N-1N−1 lines describe the edges. The ithi^{th}ith of these N−1N-1N−1 lines contains two space-separated integers uiu_iui​ and viv_ivi​, denoting an edge between uiu_iui​ and viv_ivi​.\n\n\n\n\nOutput Format\nFor each test case, output on a new line, the minimum number of operations required.",
    "constraints": [
      "1≤T≤1041 \\leq T \\leq 10^41≤T≤104",
      "1≤N≤1051 \\leq N \\leq 10^51≤N≤105",
      "1≤X≤10121 \\leq X \\leq 10^{12}1≤X≤1012",
      "1≤Ai≤1061 \\leq A_i \\leq 10^{6}1≤Ai​≤106",
      "1≤ui,vi≤N1 \\leq u_i, v_i \\leq N1≤ui​,vi​≤N",
      "ui≠viu_i \\neq v_iui​=vi​",
      "The sum of NNN over all test cases won't exceed 10510^5105.",
      "It is guaranteed that the given graph is a tree."
    ],
    "inputFormat": "",
    "outputFormat": "",
